  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5010.01 Location. Magazines for display fireworks shall be located no closer than the minimum distances from inhabited buildings, passenger railways, public highways, and from other magazines in which explosive materials are stored, as specified in table 1640.1, table of distances for storage of low explosives, in Saf-C 1640.01.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5000) #6055, eff 7-1-95; ss by #7481, eff 4-25-01, EXPIRED: 4-25-09\n\nNew. #9471, INTERIM, eff 5-15-09, EXPIRED: 11-11-09\n\nNew. #9765-A, eff 8-2-10; ss by #12124, eff 3-6-17",
